    {
      "id": "curtain-call-fa42c0dc29d417ba",
      "original_id": "p06312-fa42c0dc29d4",
      "source": "When we last left Ophelia, she was ready to use the Book of Fates to end her life.",
      "source_sha256": "fa42c0dc29d417baae3805648929e1109c95aa9caad6a9ad53162f78e5283feb",
      "previous_target": "上次我们离开奥菲莉娅时，她正准备利用命运之书结束自己的生命。",
      "target": "上回说到奥菲莉娅时，她正准备利用命运之书结束自己的生命。",
      "reason": "这是剧情回顾惯用语，不是众人上次在空间上离开女主。",
      "origins": [
        {
          "asset": "scenes",
          "asset_sha256": "6f4f49b19b3822498a7941716ea1353b8e9073dc4873406fa0fc351170acea0a",
